{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Desire</b> — It diminishes all desires, except the desire to do good, while the wicked hope to do עברה. The meaning: to transgress against others. And the measure of anger that passes beyond measure is called עברה."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:11.654614401Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}